our cursor!(Here's what you're looking for, and a short: )And as always, thanks for playing my game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T01:11:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165552328","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4050080-1835236783572494","game_id":"steam-4050080","kind":"announcement","title":"Something To Go With Tutorial Mode","summary":"Hi everyone, dev here!Today I added a new kind of tutorial. Right before dropping into the game, you can open a tutorial map that teaches the basics of the game free of spiders (mostly). I still recommend keeping Tutorial Mode on if you're new, but this should help for those who need more handholding.Here's a Short about it.And as always, thanks for playing my game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T23:07:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783572494","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4050080-1835236783566468","game_id":"steam-4050080","kind":"announcement","title":"Stats & Leaderboards","summary":"Hi everyone, dev here!The demo for Undelve came out a few days ago, and I want to thank everyone who has tried it so far! Today I have added a new option to the menu! I have been slowly adding to the Tutorial Mode and will continue to until I'm confident anyone could pick the game up and instantly understand at least the basics, but I took a moment to add some stat visuals to the game!Here's a screenshot of what that looks like.(I swear I'm good at my own game, the losses were a calculated test,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-13T19:00:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783566468","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4050080-1835236783558680","game_id":"steam-4050080","kind":"announcement","title":"Tutorial Mode","summary":"Hi everyone, dev here!Yesterday, the demo for Undelve came out, and I have received some great feedback. I've been working on a few things on the demo build, including a leaderboard, but most importantly, I have been informed that some people have no idea what they are doing (which is entirely my own fault).The demo now has a tutorial mode setting under the video tab. It is set as active by default.It's nothing fancy, just something to show you where to go/where to look, and you can toggle it on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-10T20:56:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783558680","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:36:32Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4050080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:04Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4050080":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4050080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:04Z"},"4719900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:23:05Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4050080","app_id":4050080,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_